WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
Focus the KeyMove search bar.

00:02.000 --> 00:06.000
Type “coffee” to find matching text on the page.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Press Tab to select the next matching text block. Press it again to keep moving.

00:12.000 --> 00:12.500
Press Escape to clear the query.

00:12.500 --> 00:13.000
Focus the KeyMove search bar again.

00:13.000 --> 00:14.000
Switch to action mode.

00:14.000 --> 00:20.000
Type “Save this guide” to find the button.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
Press Enter to activate the button. The guide is saved.
